    "body": "`csr.priv_mode` is defined in the UDB model as the least-privileged mode that can access the CSR (see tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/obj/csr.rb around the `priv_mode` accessor). Rendering `U` as `Any` changes the meaning (it can imply the CSR is accessible in all modes, rather than that its minimum access level is U). Consider keeping the raw mode value, or renaming the column/label to clarify what’s being shown if you intend a different concept than minimum privilege.",
    "created_at": "2026-01-31T07:18:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-31T07:18:26Z",
