    "body": "Same issue as the “By Name” table: mapping `csr.priv_mode == \"U\"` to `\"Any\"` changes the meaning of the priv_mode field (minimum access privilege). If you want to express “modes not relevant” for a U-only certificate, it would be clearer to base that on the certificate’s in-scope privileged modes rather than the CSR’s minimum privilege mode.",
