    "body": "`test_procedures.adoc.erb` is being included inside each CSR field’s sidebar, but it’s passed `db_obj => csr` and is not gated by `gen_ctp_content`. This will (a) repeat the CSR-level test procedures once per field and (b) inject a section heading into the middle of the field attribute description list, likely breaking formatting. Move the CSR-level test procedure include back to a CSR-level location (outside the field loop) and keep it behind the same `gen_ctp_content` guard used elsewhere; if the intent was field-level procedures here, pass the field object instead.",
